# `nix build` output symlinks. These are GC roots pointing into the store, so
# committing one pins a build result in a repo that otherwise only describes how
# to produce them.
result
result-*

# direnv's cache of the devShell environment, and the GC root pinning it.
.direnv

# Written by the devShell as a symlink into the store. The hook set is declared
# in modules/flake/pre-commit.nix; this is only its generated form.
.pre-commit-config.yaml
